<title>INDIA: India produces 183.51 kg gold in December.</title>
<headline>India produces 183.51 kg gold in December.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 183.51 kg of gold in December 1996 as against 182.77 kg in November, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The country produced 1,463.50 kg of gold during April-December 1996 compared to 1,217 kg in the same period last year, the statement said. ---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	 December 1996	    Cumulative production</p>
<p>	 ----------		----------------------</p>
<p>	  Actual		   Apr-Dec 96  Apr-Dec 95 -------</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------  BGML   51.89			  503.02	 474.50</p>
<p> HGML  131.62			  960.48	 742.53 ------</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------  Total 183.51			1,463.50     1,217.03 ------</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in kg and provisional.</p>
<p>	    BGML: Bharat Gold Mines Limited.</p>
<p>	    HGML: Hutti Gold Mines Limited.</p>
</text>
